- **Context window:** Unknown (no vendor figure exists). Rumored 1M–2M based on Grok 4.3/4.20 progression.
- **Modalities:** Unknown (not announced). Expected: text, image, tool calling, reasoning (based on Grok 4.x lineage).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** N/A — not released, no public API.
- **Architecture:** Rumored **6 trillion parameters** (Musk 2024/2025 claims, brimind.pro); double Grok 3/4's 3T. MoE or dense unknown; proprietary. Colossus 2 supercluster training (andrew.ooo, zbuild.io).

